    "cp": 2,
    "summary": "In either Fight phase, react once a foe has picked its attack targets. Pick a non-Vehicle Adeptus Mechanicus unit of yours from among those targets. If that defender has Battleline, you may also pick a friendly Skitarii unit without Battleline at most 6″ from the defender. Until this phase ends, apply a −1 penalty to Wound rolls for attacks against either chosen unit.",
